<https://w3id.org/mailo#P_634_004> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Encoding basis (DesignerOperationalisation): The characterisation of Art.22(1) as a prohibition rather than a right to be invoked is not anchored to its own paragraphs and remains contested in the literature. Recorded as the designer's reading pending verification."@en .
