<https://w3id.org/mailo#P_817_005> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Encoding basis (DesignerTransposition): C-817/19 paras 222-227 concern prior review of PNR disclosure requests. The bridge to a GDPR Art.35 DPIA duty is the designer's; the DPIA constraint stands on Art.35 alone."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#GDPR_v2_OmnibusProposed_Art22> <https://w3id.org/mailo#isCurrentVersion> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
