<https://w3id.org/mailo#TSD_Art2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Three-part cumulative test: information must be (1) secret (not generally known or readily accessible), (2) have commercial value because it is secret, and (3) be subject to reasonable steps to keep it secret. All three must hold for ML model weights or training data to qualify."@en .
