<https://w3id.org/mailo#lit_Kang_M_Li_B_et_al_2025_R_-Guard_Robust_Reasoning_E> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Markov logic networks + probabilistic circuits over a safety reasoning graph. +30.2% over Llama Guard on ToxicChat; +59.5% under jailbreak attacks. Direct precedent for logic-graph-as-runtime-safety-filter pattern that MAILO advances, but for general LLM safety, not medical regulation." .
