<https://w3id.org/mailo#DGA_Art3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Opens Chapter II (Arts 3-9) by fixing the categories of protected data held by public sector bodies whose re-use the Regulation conditions, including data subject to statistical or commercial confidentiality and personal data. The substantive re-use conditions, including anonymisation and the secure processing environment, are in Art.5. Applies to AI training use cases at hospitals and research institutes. Corrected in v5.1.0 Round 5: previously recorded as Art.2, the Definitions article."@en .
