<https://w3id.org/mailo#AutomatedDecisionSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Corrected in v5.1.0: this class was declared rdfs:subClassOf mailo:MedicalAISystem, which entailed that every automated decision system is a medical AI system. The credit-scoring systems in C-634/21 and C-203/22 are counter-examples in MAILO's own graph. The relation runs the other way: a medical AI system producing decisions about individuals IS an automated decision system, which is why MedicalAISystem is now the subclass."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#EPO_T1191_19> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "T 1191/19" .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#lit_Golpayegani_D_Pandit_H_J_Lewis_D_2022_2025_AIRO> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "OWL ontology + SHACL shapes implementing AI Act Annex III high-risk classifier + SPARQL ASK queries; integrated into W3C DPVCG. Most direct competitor to MAILO. AIRO already does for the AI Act what MAILO proposes for the medical-AI multi-framework intersection. Differentiator: MAILO adds medical-domain specificity, MDR+PLD integration, CJEU precedent chain, UPC patent overlay." .
