<https://w3id.org/mailo#AnnexIRoute> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The system is a product, or a safety component of a product, covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Annex I and required to undergo third-party conformity assessment. MDR and IVDR are in Annex I Section A, so Class IIa, IIb and III medical devices incorporating AI take this route automatically. Art.86 and Art.26(11), both scoped to Annex III, DO NOT APPLY. Obligations for this route apply from 2 August 2028."@en .
