<https://w3id.org/mailo#Tension_PLD_AIAct_Liability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Re-anchored in v5.1.0 from PLD Art.4 to Arts.5 and 7. Strict liability is Art.5 and the defectiveness test is Art.7; Art.4 is the definitions provision. The substance of the tension is unaffected — AI Act conformity is not a defence to a PLD claim — but it had cited the wrong provisions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#C_817_19> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "ECLI:EU:C:2022:491" .
