<https://w3id.org/mailo#DGA_Art2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Defines the terms used throughout the Regulation, including 'data', 'data holder', 'data user', 'data intermediation service' at Art.2(11) and 'data altruism'. CORRECTED in v5.1.0: previously labelled 'Re-use of Public Sector Health Data' and described as the Chapter II framework. Chapter II on re-use of protected public sector data runs from Art.3, with the categories at Art.3 and the conditions for re-use at Art.5."@en .
