<https://w3id.org/mailo#MDR> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MDR 2017/745"@en .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#P_817_002> <https://w3id.org/mailo#triggersObligation> <https://w3id.org/mailo#TransparencyObligation> .
