<https://w3id.org/mailo#lit_npj_Health_Systems_2026_Data-driven_medical_devices_and> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "ISO/IEC 27001/27010 + ISO/IEC 5338, 25059, BS 30440 are insufficient for AI medical safety/transparency — exactly the gap MAILO addresses." .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#proposedRenumberingTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/mailo#PendingAmendment> .
