<https://w3id.org/mailo#P_634_002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "C-634/21 paras 49-50: where an automated output plays a determining role in the resulting decision, establishing that output is itself a decision under Art.22(1). The Court did not set out a rubber-stamping or substantive-review standard; MAILO operationalises the determining-role test through a human-asserted substantive-oversight proxy, which is the ontology designer's construction."@en .
