<https://w3id.org/mailo#DGA_Art29> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expert group established by the Commission, comprising the competent authorities for data intermediation services and for data altruism registration from all Member States, the EDPB, the EDPS, ENISA and others. Its tasks are set out in Art.30. Includes guidance on interoperability between health data repositories used for AI training. Renumbered in v5.1.0: previously recorded as Art.31, which governs international access and transfer (Chapter VII)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#TSD_Art5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mailo#LegalArticle> .
