<https://w3id.org/mailo#Charter_Art8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Everyone has the right to the protection of personal data concerning him or her; such data must be processed fairly, for specified purposes and on a legitimate basis laid down by law; everyone has the right of access to data collected concerning them and the right to have it rectified; and compliance is subject to control by an independent authority. Art.8(2) is the Charter root of the GDPR Art.15 access right that C-203/22 and C-307/22 interpret; Art.8(3) is the independent-supervision requirement echoed in C-817/19 paras 222-227."@en .
