<https://w3id.org/mailo#appliesToRoute> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Restricts a provision to systems that became high-risk by a particular route. Art.86 is so restricted; most other high-risk obligations are not."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#DPIAObligation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Obligation to carry out a DPIA under GDPR Art.35" .
