<https://w3id.org/mailo#Tension_DataAct_TradeSecret_AITransparency> <https://w3id.org/mailo#involvesArticle> <https://w3id.org/mailo#DataAct_Art4> .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#EPC> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "European Patent Convention"@en .
