<https://w3id.org/mailo#UPC_Dexcom_Abbott> <https://w3id.org/mailo#hasOutcome> "Paris Local Division, 3 July 2024: on Dexcom's infringement action and Abbott's revocation counterclaim, EP 3 435 866 (remote monitoring of blood glucose) was revoked in its entirety for lack of inventive step, with effect across all UPC states. The patent had previously been maintained by the EPO in opposition on substantially the same grounds and prior art, making this a documented EPO-UPC divergence. The parties settled all patent disputes worldwide on 23 December 2024." .
