<https://w3id.org/mailo#EHDS_Art54> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Secondary use may not be granted for purposes adverse to the natural persons whose data it is, including decisions detrimental to them or to groups, advertising and marketing, developing products or services that may harm individuals or public health, and decisions on insurance exclusion or premium adjustment. The counterpart to Art.53 and the boundary against which any medical-AI training purpose must also be tested. Added in v5.1.0."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#CourtHolding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Court holding"@en .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#UPC_Dexcom_Abbott> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mailo#UPCCase> .
