<https://w3id.org/mailo#DGA_Art12> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Art.12(1)(a): the provider shall not use the data for which it provides intermediation services for purposes other than putting them at the disposal of data users, and shall provide the service through a separate legal person. Art.12(1)(c) restricts use of activity metadata to service development. Added in v5.1.0 to carry the neutrality obligation previously misattributed to Art.10."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#DGA_Art10> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Defines which services fall within the data intermediation regime. CORRECTED in v5.1.0: the neutrality obligation previously described here belongs to Art.12; notification is Art.11."@en .
