<https://w3id.org/mailo#GDPR> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "General Data Protection Regulation. Core data protection framework; Art.22 governs solely automated decision-making, Art.15/15(1)(h) the right of access and meaningful information, Art.9 special category health data, Art.35 DPIA obligation."@en .
