<https://w3id.org/mailo#Tension_TSD_AIAct_Transparency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Re-anchored in v5.1.0 to TSD Art.1(2)(b), which preserves rules requiring disclosure of trade secrets to administrative or judicial authorities. The Art.5 exceptions previously relied on concern freedom of expression and whistleblowing, not data-subject or regulatory disclosure."@en .
