<https://w3id.org/mailo#EHDS_Art51> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Lists what health data holders must make available: EHR data, data on factors influencing health, pathogen data, healthcare-related administrative and claims data, human genetic, epigenomic and genomic data, other molecular omics data, automatically generated personal EHD from medical devices, data from wellness applications, health-professional and health-facility data, population-based health-data registries, health-data registries and clinical-trial data. Art.51(h) and (n) in particular govern device-generated data, where industry commentary argues the scope should reach only processed human-readable information rather than raw machine data used internally to derive diagnostic scores. Added in v5.1.0."@en .
