<https://w3id.org/mailo#UPC_Hologic_Siemens> <https://w3id.org/mailo#hasOutcome> "Dusseldorf Local Division, decision of 10 June 2026 (with counterclaim UPC_CFI_259/2025): permanent injunction granted to Hologic in three member states, with recall and destruction orders against several Siemens Healthineers entities. The patent concerns the 'Flying Focal Spot' X-ray tube feature of the MAMMOMAT B.brilliant mammography system. NOTE: the item previously recorded here as a decision of 2026-03-09 was a procedural order on the further exchange of written pleadings, not the judgment."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
