<https://w3id.org/mailo#DataAct_Art14> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Where a public sector body, the Commission, the ECB or a Union body demonstrates an exceptional need under Art.15, the data holder shall make the data available. The obligation Art.15 qualifies and Art.17 procedurally implements. Added in v5.1.0: MAILO recorded the Chapter V machinery without the provision that creates the duty."@en .
