<https://w3id.org/mailo#DataAct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Data Act. Applies from 2025-09-12. Governs data sharing obligations for IoT-generated data (medical devices, wearables) and B2G/B2B data access for AI development."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#MDR_Art83> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "PMS system must collect real-world performance data. For AI-SaMD: continuous monitoring of model drift and performance degradation in deployment populations."@en .
