<https://w3id.org/mailo#UPC_Sanofi_Amgen> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SCOPE CORRECTION and UNVERIFIED (v5.1.0). The instance was declared DirectSubjectMatter while its own note concedes the case is 'biologic rather than AI' — an internal contradiction. PCSK9 antibody claims involve no AI, so the basis is moved to DomainContext. The substantive assertions — a Dusseldorf LD finding of validity without infringement, a 'dual-element test', Court of Appeal restoration of EP'797 after Munich CD revocation, and an EPO Board hearing in April 2026 — are separately checkable and none has been verified. The status date has now passed. This is also the only UPC instance recording neither plaintiff nor defendant. Do not cite until checked."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#hasTemporalLimitation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Tri-level proportionality (c): temporal limitation or review schedule" .
