<https://w3id.org/mailo#UPC_Dexcom_Abbott> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "CORRECTED in v5.1.0. (1) The earlier record said the Paris LD revoked both EP 3 435 866 and EP 3 831 282. Only EP 866 was revoked in this decision; EP 282 was the subject of separate actions. (2) The recorded identifier ACT_583778/2023 is a different Paris action and does not correspond to the decision described; the correct reference is UPC_CFI_230/2023 (ACT_546446/2023). (3) decidedBy Munich LD is removed: Munich heard separate Dexcom actions, not this one. (4) involvesTechnology RiskScoringSystem is removed — a continuous glucose monitor is a sensing and measurement device, not a risk-scoring system. Whether any AI element is claimed has not been established, so no replacement technology is asserted."@en .
